  }
 ],
 "cards": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "text",
   "title": "概述",
   "body": [
    {
     "p": "空位是谓语时，动词形式要和主语、时间相符。The shop opens at nine 中，主语是单数，说的是日常情况，所以用 opens。"
    },
    {
     "p": "句子已有谓语时，空位填非谓语形式。They stopped to rest 中，stopped 是谓语，to rest 表示目的。词库里的词照原样填入，不自行改动词尾。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "finite",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "谓语空位",
   "cols": [
    "结构",
    "例一",
    "例二"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "单数主语与现在时间",
     "The train leaves at noon.",
     "The shop opens at nine."
    ],
    [
     "复数主语与现在时间",
     "The trains leave at noon.",
     "The shops open at nine."
    ],
    [
     "过去时间",
     "The train left yesterday.",
     "The shop opened last week."
    ],
    [
     "助动词 have 后",
     "They have finished the task.",
     "She has written the report."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "helpers",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "助动词后的形式",
   "cols": [
    "结构",
    "形式",
    "例"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "can、will 等情态动词后",
     "动词原形",
     "Visitors can enter at noon."
    ],
    [
     "do、does 后",
     "动词原形",
     "Does the shop open at nine?"
    ],
    [
     "have、has 后",
     "过去分词",
     "The team has completed the plan."
    ],
    [
     "be 后表进行",
     "现在分词",
     "Workers are repairing the bridge."
    ],
    [
     "be 后表被动",
     "过去分词",
     "The bridge was repaired yesterday."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "nonfinite",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "非谓语空位",
   "cols": [
    "结构",
    "例一",
    "例二"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "to 后动词原形表目的",
     "She stopped to rest.",
     "They met to discuss the plan."
    ],
    [
     "介词后动名词",
     "He left without speaking.",
     "She learned by observing."
    ],
    [
     "现在分词作后置修饰",
     "The girl carrying a bag smiled.",
     "The birds nesting nearby returned."
    ],
    [
     "过去分词作后置修饰",
     "The door painted blue is open.",
     "The book borrowed yesterday is here."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "worked",
   "type": "text",
   "title": "例题",
   "body": [
    {
     "box": "The workers have _____ the old gate, so visitors can use it again.\n1. repair\n2. repaired\n3. repairing\n4. repairs"
    },
    {
     "p": "have 后接过去分词，即第二项 repaired。后半句说游客又能使用大门，说明维修已经完成。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
