       "answer": 0,
       "why": "every morning 说的是日常情况，主语 The museum 是单数，所以用 opens。",
       "point": "form"
      },
      {
       "stem": "The museum _____ its doors yesterday after repairs.",
       "options": [
        "opening",
        "opened",
        "opens",
