       "answer": 1,
       "why": "yesterday 表示过去时间，谓语用 opened。",
       "point": "finite"
      },
      {
       "stem": "Visitors can _____ the garden through the side gate.",
       "options": [
        "entered",
        "entering",
        "enter",
